docs/Standardization_Plan.md

# Demo clips: only the 1.5x set the README embeds is committed. The other speeds and the superseded
# GIFs are kept locally for comparing takes — the full set at three speeds is ~66MB against a ~22MB
# repo, and git history cannot be slimmed down again afterwards. Regenerate any speed on demand:
# SPEED=1.25 ./scripts/make-demo-clips.sh
docs/assets/demo/*
!docs/assets/demo/*-1.5x.webp
